   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The prompt, the model's output and the tool result,\nagainst content-safety classes: jailbreak, indirect attack\n(in the prompt and after a tool call), hate, sexual,\nviolence and self-harm at Medium. Protected material is\nflagged, not blocked.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d05_0042",
   "originalText": "The prompt, the model's output and the tool result,\nagainst content-safety classes: jailbreak, indirect attack\n(in the prompt and after a tool call), hate, sexual,\nviolence and self-harm at Medium. Protected material is\nflagged, not blocked.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
