   "text": "The run stops, and the Foundry span carries error.type =\ncontent_filter. A preview control that fires on only some\nattacks, so the walls below never rely on it.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d05_0046",
