   "text": "The token again, because the server does not rely on\nthe gateway: signature, audience, issuer, tenant, azp,\nscope. Then the tool: tools/list is filtered by role, and\ntools/call needs the role and passes the tool's own rule.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d05_0068",
   "originalText": "The token again, because the server does not rely on\nthe gateway: signature, audience, issuer, tenant, azp,\nscope. Then the tool: tools/list is filtered by role, and\ntools/call needs the role and passes the tool's own rule.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
