   "text": "Client allow-list. abw-allowed-azp admits only\nthe agent client, the test client and the Azure\nCLI client at the gateway, and the MCP\nserver checks azp again.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
