   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Group membership. People get data access\nonly through groups, and the operator holds\nno data role of its own. Leave the group and\nWall 3 refuses, even while the token still\ncarries the role (the drift ABW-007 watches).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d05_0091",
   "originalText": "Group membership. People get data access\nonly through groups, and the operator holds\nno data role of its own. Leave the group and\nWall 3 refuses, even while the token still\ncarries the role (the drift ABW-007 watches).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
